+/* SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
+ * Native adaptation of MaternalBound Redux's documented CCExpand behavior.
+ * Credit: ShadowOne333 and upstream contributors; see CREDITS.md and source
+ * references below. This module is licensed separately from the foundation. */
